WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:07.148
Releases shows, for every project, what is waiting for you, what is live, and what was released.

2
00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:13.483
Open Releases in the sidebar. Waiting for you lists the versions that are ready for a site.

3
00:00:14.183 --> 00:00:18.212
Release puts the version on the site, with the setup the Owner approved.

4
00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:23.273
Not now takes a version off the list. Nothing changes on that site.

5
00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:33.716
What is live shows the version on each site, since when, and where it runs. A site with nothing waiting offers Release the newest version on its project page.

6
00:00:34.415 --> 00:00:42.389
History lists every release, who asked for it and who released it. Filter it by project, site or result.

7
00:00:43.092 --> 00:00:51.589
Under Rules, the standard rule says what must be true before a version goes live. The advanced rule sets hold the details.

8
00:00:52.288 --> 00:00:58.602
Freeze all releases stops everything from going live. Lift the freeze when you are ready again.

9
00:00:59.301 --> 00:01:02.970
That is Releases: one place to decide what goes live.
